bornona-ibus (0.1.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix floating bar silently crashing on startup on desktops without
    AppIndicator3/AyatanaAppIndicator3 (e.g. plain Ubuntu GNOME) --
    the bar now degrades gracefully with minimize-to-tray disabled
    instead of failing to launch at all.
  * Harden IBus engine auto-selection against a GLib.Error some setups
    raise when no global engine has ever been configured.
  * Bar window now always shows first; IBus setup happens afterward
    and can no longer prevent the window from appearing.
  * Uncaught startup errors now print a real traceback to stderr
    instead of failing silently with no diagnostic trail.

 -- Bornona IBus project <imdashraful17@gmail.com>  Wed, 12 Aug 2026 04:45:00 +0600

